---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import Main from "@/components/Main.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "@/components/Breadcrumb.astro";
import config from "@/config";
---

<Layout
  title={`Apps | ${config.site.title}`}
  description="Kewei Yan 开发的 iOS、macOS 应用与个人工具。"
>
  <Header />
  <Breadcrumb />
  <Main pageTitle="Apps">
    <p class="mb-8">
      除了写文章，我也会做一些解决自己问题的应用和工具。它们从真实使用场景开始，尽量保持功能明确、界面克制。
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <div class="border-border rounded-lg border p-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <img
            src="/image/apps/lunarloop.png"
            alt="日月有期 icon"
            width="64"
            height="64"
            class="h-16 w-16 rounded-xl"
          />
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
                <a href="/apps/lunarloop" class="text-accent hover:underline">
                  日月有期
                </a>
              </h2>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">
                iOS · 日期提醒
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-foreground/80 mt-2 text-sm">
              同时支持农历与公历的重要日子倒数，让生日、纪念日和节日如期而至。
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/apps/lunarloop"
            class="text-accent text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap hover:underline"
          >
            了解详情 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-border rounded-lg border p-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <img
            src="/image/apps/qdii-watch.png"
            alt="QDII Watch icon"
            width="64"
            height="64"
            class="h-16 w-16 rounded-xl"
          />
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
                <a href="/apps/qdii-watch" class="text-accent hover:underline">
                  QDII Watch
                </a>
              </h2>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">
                Web · Investment Tool
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-foreground/80 mt-2 text-sm">
              监控中国大陆纳斯达克100 ETF联接基金（QDII）的申购限额情况。
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/apps/qdii-watch"
            class="text-accent text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap hover:underline"
          >
            了解详情 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-border rounded-lg border p-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
          <img
            src="/image/apps/key-dock.png"
            alt="Key Dock icon"
            width="64"
            height="64"
            class="h-16 w-16 rounded-xl"
          />
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
                <a href="/apps/key-dock" class="text-accent hover:underline">
                  Key Dock
                </a>
              </h2>
              <span class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">
                macOS · Developer Utility
              </span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-foreground/80 mt-2 text-sm">
              把 API 密钥留在系统钥匙串里，而不是散落在配置文件和聊天记录中。
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/apps/key-dock"
            class="text-accent text-sm font-medium whitespace-nowrap hover:underline"
          >
            了解详情 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-foreground/60 mt-8 text-sm">
      新应用会继续加入这里。每个应用都会有独立页面，用于说明用途、设计取舍和访问方式。
    </p>
  </Main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
